  <!-- ── 02 Ablauf ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><b>02</b> <span lang="de">Ablauf</span><span lang="en">How it works</span><span lang="fr">Déroulé</span><span lang="es">Cómo funciona</span><span lang="zh">使用流程</span><span lang="hi">यह कैसे काम करता है</span><span lang="ar">آلية العمل</span></p>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);max-width:24ch">
        <span lang="de">Importieren, analysieren, verstehen.</span>
        <span lang="en">Import, analyze, understand.</span>
        <span lang="fr">Importer, analyser, comprendre.</span>
        <span lang="es">Importar, analizar, entender.</span>
        <span lang="zh">导入、分析、看懂。</span>
        <span lang="hi">आयात करें, विश्लेषण करें, समझें।</span>
        <span lang="ar">استورد، حلّل، افهم.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="flow rv" style="margin-top:34px">
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">01</p>
          <h3><span lang="de">Importieren</span><span lang="en">Import</span><span lang="fr">Importer</span><span lang="es">Importar</span><span lang="zh">导入</span><span lang="hi">आयात</span><span lang="ar">الاستيراد</span></h3>
          <p><span lang="de">Benutzername eintragen, fertig. Kiebitz holt die komplette Historie: duplikatsicher, auch als PGN für Brettpartien.</span><span lang="en">Enter your username, that’s it. Kiebitz pulls your whole history: duplicate-safe, and PGN for over-the-board games.</span><span lang="fr">Saisissez votre pseudo, c’est tout. Kiebitz récupère tout l’historique, sans doublons, et accepte le PGN pour les parties sur échiquier.</span><span lang="es">Escribe tu nombre de usuario y listo. Kiebitz trae todo el historial, sin duplicados, y acepta PGN para las partidas sobre el tablero.</span><span lang="zh">填上用户名就行。Kiebitz 会取回完整历史，自动去重，也支持 PGN 导入实地对局。</span><span lang="hi">यूज़रनेम डालिए, बस। Kiebitz पूरा इतिहास ले आता है — बिना डुप्लिकेट, और बोर्ड पर खेली बाज़ियों के लिए PGN भी।</span><span lang="ar">أدخل اسم المستخدم، وهذا كل شيء. يجلب Kiebitz تاريخك كاملًا دون تكرار، ويقبل ملفات PGN لمباريات الرقعة.</span></p>
          <div class="step-viz srcrow">
            <span class="srcpill cc">chess.com</span>
            <span class="srcpill li">lichess</span>
            <span class="srcpill pgn">PGN</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">02</p>
          <h3><span lang="de">Analysieren</span><span lang="en">Analyze</span><span lang="fr">Analyser</span><span lang="es">Analizar</span><span lang="zh">分析</span><span lang="hi">विश्लेषण</span><span lang="ar">التحليل</span></h3>
          <p><span lang="de">Ein nativer Stockfish arbeitet die Warteschlange im Hintergrund ab: Bewertung pro Zug, Ungenauigkeit, Fehler, Blunder, Genauigkeit.</span><span lang="en">A native Stockfish works through the queue in the background: eval per move, inaccuracy, mistake, blunder, accuracy.</span><span lang="fr">Un Stockfish natif traite la file d’attente en arrière-plan : évaluation par coup, imprécision, erreur, gaffe, précision.</span><span lang="es">Un Stockfish nativo procesa la cola en segundo plano: evaluación por jugada, imprecisión, error, error grave, precisión.</span><span lang="zh">原生 Stockfish 在后台处理队列：逐着评分，标出不精确、失误、严重失误与准确率。</span><span lang="hi">नेटिव Stockfish पृष्ठभूमि में कतार निपटाता है: हर चाल का मूल्यांकन, अशुद्धि, ग़लती, ब्लंडर, सटीकता।</span><span lang="ar">يعالج محرّك Stockfish أصلي قائمة الانتظار في الخلفية: تقييم لكل نقلة، وعدم دقة، وخطأ، وخطأ فادح، ونسبة دقة.</span></p>
          <div class="step-viz">
            <div class="evalbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="w" style="width:52%"></span><span class="b"></span></div>
            <div class="evalticks" aria-hidden="true"><span>1. e4</span><span class="bad">24. Nf3?? −3.1</span><span>41. Kg2</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <p class="step-n">03</p>
          <h3><span lang="de">Verstehen</span><span lang="en">Understand</span><span lang="fr">Comprendre</span><span lang="es">Entender</span><span lang="zh">看懂</span><span lang="hi">समझें</span><span lang="ar">الفهم</span></h3>
          <p><span lang="de">Nicht „gut gespielt“, sondern: in welcher Phase, in welcher Eröffnung, unter welcher Bedenkzeit es kippt.</span><span lang="en">Not “well played”, but: which phase, which opening, which time control is where it falls apart.</span><span lang="fr">Pas « bien joué », mais : à quelle phase, dans quelle ouverture, sous quelle cadence ça bascule.</span><span lang="es">No «bien jugado», sino: en qué fase, en qué apertura y con qué ritmo se te viene abajo.</span><span lang="zh">不是“下得不错”，而是：在哪个阶段、哪个开局、哪种用时规则下崩盘。</span><span lang="hi">“अच्छा खेले” नहीं, बल्कि: किस चरण में, किस ओपनिंग में, किस टाइम कंट्रोल में बात बिगड़ती है।</span><span lang="ar">ليس «أحسنتَ اللعب»، بل: في أي طور، وفي أي افتتاح، وتحت أي توقيت ينهار أداؤك.</span></p>
          <div class="step-viz bars" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="bar"><span class="bar-l"><span lang="de">Eröffnung</span><span lang="en">Opening</span><span lang="fr">Ouverture</span><span lang="es">Apertura</span><span lang="zh">开局</span><span lang="hi">ओपनिंग</span><span lang="ar">الافتتاح</span></span><span class="bar-t"><i data-w="22"></i></span><span class="bar-v">0.4</span></div>
            <div class="bar hot"><span class="bar-l"><span lang="de">Mittelspiel</span><span lang="en">Middlegame</span><span lang="fr">Milieu de partie</span><span lang="es">Medio juego</span><span lang="zh">中局</span><span lang="hi">मध्य खेल</span><span lang="ar">وسط المباراة</span></span><span class="bar-t"><i data-w="78"></i></span><span class="bar-v">1.9</span></div>
            <div class="bar"><span class="bar-l"><span lang="de">Endspiel</span><span lang="en">Endgame</span><span lang="fr">Finale</span><span lang="es">Final</span><span lang="zh">残局</span><span lang="hi">अंतिम खेल</span><span lang="ar">نهاية المباراة</span></span><span class="bar-t"><i data-w="46"></i></span><span class="bar-v">0.9</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

